    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d135">

                <pb facs="0244" n="140" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg140"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.00/2041.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-12-16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 16, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Nearly all the Ministers, and the Chinese themselves, believe withdrawal of
                    troops would be premature.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Reinsch</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
